er's rounding (per FIN-212), but the code actually used `ROUND_HALF_UP`. That's why the test expecting `2.665` to round to `2.66` failed.\n- **Fix:** On a new branch, `fix/money-banker-rounding`, I changed one line so it uses `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n- **PR:** #101 (https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101). I haven't merged it, because merging into main needs a code owner's approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}